# src/apps/android/app/src/test/java/com/luminet/android/tunnel

## Purpose
Provides host-side unit coverage for Android tunnel and VPN lifecycle coordination logic.

## Contents
Contains JVM tests and fixtures for tunnel state transitions, routing decisions, and lifecycle helpers that can run without a device.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Exercises production tunnel contracts through mocks or pure logic while Gradle supplies application and test dependencies.

## Invariants
Tests must characterize cleanup and transition semantics, remain deterministic without a live VPN, and prevent shared lifecycle state from leaking between cases.